      "round_summary": "Round 1: Fixed age-comparison typo in issue0_2 and issue1_2. Error type: dut_bug. Affected properties: issue0_mutex, issue1_mutex (directly), plus progress properties (indirect secondary effect). Root cause: In both issue0_2 (line 51) and issue1_2 (line 63), the age check `(qAge(2) | ...)` uses the wrong polarity — qAge(2)=1 means \"entry 1 is older than entry 2\", so entry 2 should check `~qAge(2)` for priority over entry 1. Fixed by changing `qAge(2)` to `~qAge(2)` in both locations. The other qAge(2) usages (in issue0_1, issue1_1, and qAge update logic) are correct because there entry 1 checks priority over entry 2. All assertions preserved with original labels.",
