      "round": 3,
      "round_summary": "Round 3: Strengthened fairness assumption to fix 3 failing liveness properties (entry0_progress, entry1_progress, entry2_progress). Error type: setup_error. Root cause: The single exeReadyTimer tracking exeReady.orR was too weak — when exec unit 0 became ready but was consumed by an older entry (entry 1), the global timer reset, allowing entry 0 to starve indefinitely. Fix: Replaced single exeReadyTimer with per-unit timers (exeReady0Timer, exeReady1Timer), each requiring its respective execution unit to be ready at least once every 7 cycles. This prevents the solver from starving a younger entry by having an older entry always consume exec unit 0 while exec unit 1 stays idle. All 17 original assertion labels preserved unchanged. No homologous assertions needed (constraint strengthening, not assertion repair).",
